          <h3 className=\"font-mono text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n89:                           {project.title}\n90:                         </h3>\n91:                         <ArrowUpRight className=\"h-5 w-5 text-[var(--text-muted)] transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:text-[var(--accent)]\" />\n92:                       </div>\n93:                       <p className=\"mt-3 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] max-w-lg\">\n94:                         {project.description}\n95:                       </p>\n96:                     </div>\n97:                     <div className=\"mt-4 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">\n98:                       {project.year}\n99:                     </div>\n100:                   </div>\n101:                 </div>\n102:               </Link>\n103:             </motion.div>\n104:           ))}\n105:         </motion.div>\n106: \n107:         {/* Mobile link */}\n108:         <div className=\"mt-8 text-center sm:hidden\">\n109:           <Link\n110:             href=\"/work\"\n111:             className=\"brutalist-button brutalist-button-accent text-xs\"\n112:           >\n113:             View All Projects →\n114:           </Link>\n115:         </div>\n116:       </div>\n117:     </section>\n118:   );\n119: }\n120: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
