{"step_index":591,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-07-24T02:07:14Z","thinking":"**Prioritizing Tool Usage**\n\nI'm now focusing on tool selection, emphasizing specific tools over general ones where possible. The goal is to optimize efficiency by leveraging tools tailored to particular tasks, like viewing files. This strategy promises a more targeted and less error-prone approach to problem-solving, which I will continue to refine and implement moving forward.\n\n\n**Refining Tool Choice**\n\nI'm now implementing new tool selection rules, especially for core actions. I'm avoiding `cat` for file operations and prioritizing `grep_search` where appropriate, using specific tools instead of general ones. Before executing any toolset, I'll explicitly list all related tools to ensure the most optimized choice. This will be the new foundation for my approach to tool usage.\n\n\n**Analyzing Project Selections**\n\nI'm now analyzing project selections and implementing conditional image choices based on project IDs, using helper functions for image name retrieval. I'm also ensuring the mouse position is correctly calculated for image offsets, to position the cursor image effectively relative to the hovered project. This includes setting the image width and height as variables to make adjustments easier. My immediate focus is on dynamically displaying project details based on user interaction.\n\n\n**Evaluating Project Elements**\n\nI'm now focusing on analyzing project list interactions, specifically implementing hover effects. I'm dynamically updating state based on mouse events to highlight selected projects. The aim is to create a more engaging user experience by visually emphasizing projects as the user interacts with them. This involves adjusting the state based on the element IDs, and I'm concentrating on the visual aspects of these states now.\n\n\n**Implementing Project Highlighting**\n\nI'm now implementing project de-selection on mouse leave events. I'm focusing on ensuring projects are properly de-selected when the mouse moves off of a project. I'm dynamically updating the `hoveredProject` state to `null` to clear the visual highlighting. The emphasis is on a clean visual feedback loop for user interactions, ensuring visual clarity in the project display.\n\n\n**Refining Display Logic**\n\nI'm now implementing the display logic. I'm focusing on rendering a floating image that is attached to the cursor, conditionally showing it only on desktop where hover makes sense. I've added a conditional render, using AnimatePresence for transitions, and I am also ensuring that overflow is hidden on mobile to provide a more tailored view. I am using `motion.div` for a smooth transition.\n\n\n**Adjusting Hover Effects**\n\nI'm now refining the hover effects, and I've focused on ensuring the floating image and its associated elements are accurately positioned relative to the cursor. I've adjusted the image's dimensions, incorporating opacity, scale, and transitions for a smoother visual effect on desktop. The goal is to provide a dynamic and visually appealing preview that enhances user interaction.\n\n\n**Revising Text Display**\n\nI'm now revising the text display strategy, specifically the project titles. Initially, I considered truncating or splitting long titles. However, I've decided to render the full `project.title` and let it wrap if necessary. I've also re-evaluated the use of Framer Motion and decided that, while `useSpring` and `useTransform` would provide smoother transitions, directly updating the `left` and `top` properties via React state is acceptable for performance.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"use client\";\n\nimport { motion, AnimatePresence } from \"framer-motion\";\nimport Link from \"next/link\";\nimport Image from \"next/image\";\nimport { useState } from \"react\";\nimport { useMousePosition } from \"@/hooks/useMousePosition\";\nimport { PROJECTS } from \"@/lib/projects\";\nimport { ArrowUpRight } from \"lucide-react\";\n\n// We dynamically pull featured projects from our central data source\nconst featured = PROJECTS.filter((project) => project.featured);\n\nconst getImageName = (id: string) => {\n  if (id.includes(\"polo\")) return \"polo-pantoja\";\n  if (id.includes(\"edusur\")) return \"edusur\";\n  if (id.includes(\"salesforce\")) return \"salesforce-ai\";\n  if (id.includes(\"aca\")) return \"aca-diario\";\n  return \"polo-pantoja\";\n};\n\nexport function SelectWork() {\n  const [hoveredProject, setHoveredProject] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const { x, y } = useMousePosition();\n\n  // Dimensions for the floating image attached to the cursor\n  const imageWidth = 350;\n  const imageHeight = 450;\n\n  return (\n    <section className=\"relative w-full bg-[var(--bg-primary)] py-24 md:py-40 overflow-hidden\">\n      <div className=\"container-padded\">\n        {/* Header */}\n        <div className=\"mb-12 flex items-end justify-between md:mb-20\">\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--accent)]\">\n              Selected Work\n            </p>\n            <h2 className=\"heading text-h2 mt-4 uppercase\">Featured<br />Projects</h2>\n          </div>\n          <Link\n            href=\"/work\"\n            className=\"hidden items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline sm:flex transition-all\"\n          >\n            View All <ArrowUpRight className=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n          </Link>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* The List (Locomotive Style) */}\n        <div className=\"flex flex-col border-t-2 border-[var(--border)] relative z-10\">\n          {featured.map((project) => (\n            <Link\n              href={`/work/${project.id}`}\n              key={project.id}\n              className=\"group block border-b-2 border-[var(--border)] py-8 md:py-12 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-[var(--bg-hero)]\"\n              onMouseEnter={() => setHoveredProject(project.id)}\n              onMouseLeave={() => setHoveredProject(null)}\n            >\n              <div className=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between px-4 md:px-8\">\n                \n                {/* Title and Index */}\n                <div className=\"flex items-start md:items-center gap-4 md:gap-12 overflow-hidden\">\n                  <span className=\"font-mono text-sm font-bold text-[var(--text-muted)] group-hover:text-[var(--accent)] transition-colors duration-500\">\n                    {project.indexCode}\n                  </span>\n                  <h3 className=\"font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-[5rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter text-[var(--text-primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--text-inverse)] transition-all duration-500 md:group-hover:translate-x-6 truncate\">\n                    {project.title}\n                  </h3>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Meta details (hidden on mobile, visible on desktop) */}\n                <div className=\"hidden md:flex flex-col items-end text-right shrink-0\">\n                  <span className=\"font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--text-primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--text-inverse)] transition-colors duration-500\">\n                    {project.category}\n                  </span>\n                  <span className=\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] opacity-50 group-hover:text-[var(--text-inverse)] transition-colors duration-500 mt-2\">\n                    {project.year}\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </Link>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Mobile View All */}\n        <div className=\"mt-12 text-center sm:hidden\">\n          <Link\n            href=\"/work\"\n            className=\"brutalist-button brutalist-button-accent text-xs\"\n          >\n            View All Projects →\n          </Link>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Floating Image attached to Cursor */}\n      <AnimatePresence>\n        {hoveredProject && (\n          <motion.div\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.5, rotate: -5 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1, rotate: 0 }}\n            exit={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.5, rotate: 5 }}\n            transition={{ type: \"spring\", stiffness: 100, damping: 20 }}\n            className=\"fixed pointer-events-none z-50 hidden md:block\"\n            style={{\n              left: x - imageWidth / 2,\n              top: y - imageHeight / 2,\n              width: imageWidth,\n              height: imageHeight,\n            }}\n          >\n            <div className=\"relative w-full h-full border-2 border-[var(--border)] shadow-[16px_16px_0px_0px_var(--accent)] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--bg-hero)]\">\n              <Image\n                src={`/projects/${getImageName(hoveredProject)}.jpg`}\n                alt=\"Project Preview\"\n                fill\n                sizes=\"350px\"\n                className=\"object-cover\"\n                priority\n              />\n              {/* Overlay */}\n              <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 mix-blend-multiply\" />\n            </div>\n            \n            {/* View Project Floating Tag */}\n            <div className=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-[var(--bg-hero)] text-[var(--text-inverse)] border border-[var(--text-inverse)] font-mono text-xs uppercase px-4 py-2 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap shadow-lg backdrop-blur-sm\">\n              View Case ↗\n            </div>\n          </motion.div>\n        )}\n      </AnimatePresence>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","Description":"Re-write SelectWork to implement Locomotive-style marquee list with hover cursor image reveal","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/components/home/SelectWork.tsx","toolAction":"Rewrite SelectWork to Locomotive style","toolSummary":"Create file"}}]}
