\n\n### 2. User Knowledge\n- **Design Inspiration:** \"https://locomotive.ca/en por favor referencia a los agentes la inspiracion.\"\n- **Style Preference:** \"Híbrido Brutalista (Crudo + Elegante)\". \n- **Visual Directives:** \n    - No numbering, no year, no background color changes, centered text.\n    - \"No digas de que es la app, solo el nombre podria ser.\"\n    - \"No vamos a poner lineas de separacion, mas bien, que una linea cruce la mitad del nombre de lado a lado y se corte en la letra.\" (Refined to current lines).\n    - \"Que la imagen no ocupe mas espacio que las letras\" (Now constrained to 1.5em height).\n    - Pixelation style: \"que aparezca de la mitad a los lados, aparezca con pixeles... y que se le quiten dichos pixeles.\" (Implemented via custom Canvas `PixelImage`).\n    - Typography weight: \"la letra con menos peso. mucho mas thin\" (`font-light`).\n    - Animation pacing: \"Mucho mas rapido\" (Scrambler at 15ms, reveal at 0.25s).\n    - Monochromatic: \"las lineas de la mitad que sean negras al igual que la letra.\"\n\n### 3. Work Accomplished\n- **Scramble Effect:** Implemented high-speed `ScrambleText` component to reveal titles.\n- **Pixelation Engine:** Developed `PixelImage.tsx` using HTML5 Canvas to animate raw pixel blocks revealing a high-resolution image, ensuring a crisp finish on Retina displays.\n- **SelectWork Refinement:** \n    - Migrated from Next `Image` to `PixelImage` canvas for pixel-reveal.\n    - Updated container to `min-h-[180px]` to prevent layout shifts.\n    - Enforced `font-light` and monochrome lines (`var(--text-primary)`).\n- **Core Rules:** Updated `/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/.agents/rules/core.md` to establish Locomotive.ca as the permanent design standard.\n\n### 4. Model Knowledge\n- **Layout Management:** Used `whitespace-nowrap` and `overflow-hidden` to prevent layout shifts when the image expands.\n- **Canvas Rendering:** `PixelImage.tsx` uses `devicePixelRatio` to mai