{"step_index":804,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-07-24T02:41:10Z","content":"{{ CHECKPOINT 7 }}\n **The earlier parts of this conversation have been truncated due to its long length. The following content summarizes the truncated context so that you may continue your work. **\n\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. Me gusta, pero el efecto se ve muy... mecanisado, podria ser mas smooth?\n2. una ultima opcion para ver todos los projectos.\n3. muy largo el view all projects. all projects, o all works.. sin la flecha. que al hacer hover se agregen dos * uno al inicio y otro al final y que si el hover se matniene, parpadee y cambie de * a _ de forma intermitente.\n4. quita el view all de arriba.\n5. en pantalla grande las lineas no van hasta los bordes com oen pantalla laptop. la linea mas thin por favor.\n6. el all works cambia de color al hacer hover... no. el intermitente es muy rapido. que sea mucho mas lento. como 1 segundo\n7. la linea llega mucho hasta los bordes, deja un espacio.\n8. hagamos una cosa, la letra pesada la vamos a dejar para el hero. en el resto vamos a usar letra mas thin. como en el our process o el featured projects, que lo quisiera en una linea\n9. por que el our process es mas pesado que el featured projects.\n10. hay mucho espacio de separacion entre project y project\n\n# Previous Session Summary:\n### 1. Outstanding User Requests\n- **Implement About / Our Philosophy (Fase 5):** The user expressed readiness to move to this phase. Status: **NOT STARTED**.\n\n### 2. User Knowledge\n- **Design Inspiration:** \"https://locomotive.ca/en por favor referencia a los agentes la inspiracion.\"\n- **Style Preference:** \"Híbrido Brutalista (Crudo + Elegante)\".\n- **Visual Directives:**\n    - \"No digas de que es la app, solo el nombre podria ser.\"\n    - Lines: \"las lineas deben ser negras con o sin hover\", \"la linea mas thin por favor\", \"la linea llega mucho hasta los bordes, deja un espacio\" (Implemented as 1px, full-width with responsive side padding).\n    - Typography: \"la letra con menos peso. mucho mas thin\" (Global `.heading` weight set to 300).\n    - \"all works.. sin la flecha. que al hacer hover se agregen dos * uno al inicio y otro al final y que si el hover se matniene, parpadee y cambie de * a _ de forma intermitente. ... como 1 segundo\".\n    - \"la letra pesada la vamos a dejar para el hero. en el resto vamos a usar letra mas thin\".\n\n### 3. Work Accomplished\n- **Scramble Effect:** High-speed text randomization implemented.\n- **Pixelation Engine:** Canvas-based `PixelImage.tsx` with high-res Retina support and cinematic crossfade \"melt\" effect.\n- **SelectWork Refinement:**\n    - Removed top \"View All\" link header.\n    - Added stylized \"ALL WORKS\" CTA row at the bottom with a 1s interval blinking cursor effect (`*` to `_`).\n    - Standardized list row heights (`min-h-[90px] md:min-h-[110px]`) and implemented responsive horizontal padding.\n- **Global Typography:** Set `.heading` weight to 300 globally in `globals.css` to enforce \"thin\" aesthetic for all sections except the Hero.\n- **Component Fixes:**\n    - Fixed `Our Process` title weighting in `WorkflowSteps.tsx` (overrode local `font-bold` to `font-light`).\n    - Optimized canvas rendering in `PixelImage.tsx` to use `naturalWidth` for crispness.\n\n### 4. Model Knowledge\n- **Architecture & Interfaces:** `PixelImage.tsx` uses a dual-buffer approach (offscreen canvas for pixelation, main canvas for crossfaded sharp image).\n- **Styling Strategy:** Use `globals.css` for system-wide typography weights to avoid drift. Tailwind's `group-hover` is utilized for interaction state management.\n- **Failures:** Initially, the pixelation felt \"mechanical\" due to block resizing jitter; solved by overlaying a sharp image with an exponential fade.\n- **Constraints:** Canvas scaling on high-DPI displays requires setting internal dimensions to `naturalWidth/Height` before CSS scaling kicks in.\n\n### 5. Files and Code\n- **Edited Files:**\n    - `/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/components/home/SelectWork.tsx`: Core project list UI, CTA logic, and layout.\n    - `/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/components/ui/PixelImage.tsx`: High-fidelity pixelation engine.\n    - `/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/app/globals.css`: Global typography rules (headings set to 300 weight).\n    - `/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/components/home/WorkflowSteps.tsx`: Fixed title weight and layout.\n- **Viewed Files:**\n    - `/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/lib/projects.ts`: Source of project data.\n    - `/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/.agents/rules/core.md`: Design standards reference.\n\n### 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n- **Next Step:** Begin **Fase 5: About / Our Philosophy**.\n- **Context:** The \"Featured Projects\" section is now fully refined according to the user's \"Thin/Brutalist\" visual standards.\n- **Rules Reference:** Re-read `/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/.agents/rules/core.md` before starting the About page to maintain the Locomotive.ca design language.\n- **Pending Task:** Transition to the layout of the \"About\" page, ensuring consistency with the now-established typography (thin headings) and component style.\n\nYou have the 4 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: aca_diario_1784858012774]\nPath: file:///home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/aca_diario_1784858012774.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-07-24T01:53:32Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: edusur_1784857998587]\nPath: file:///home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/edusur_1784857998587.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-07-24T01:53:18Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: polo_pantoja_1784857990917]\nPath: file:///home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/polo_pantoja_1784857990917.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-07-24T01:53:10Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: salesforce_ai_1784858005915]\nPath: file:///home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/salesforce_ai_1784858005915.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-07-24T01:53:25Z\n\n# Running Background Tasks\nThe following background tasks were running at the time this checkpoint was created.\nUse the manage_task tool to interact with them (e.g. to kill them or check their status).\n\n{\n  \"taskId\":  \"74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/task-510\",\n  \"toolName\":  \"run_command\",\n  \"toolSummary\":  \"Run command\",\n  \"description\":  \"rm -rf .next/ && npm run dev\",\n  \"startTime\":  \"2026-07-23T20:48:42.792597175Z\",\n  \"stepIndex\":  510,\n  \"logUri\":  \"file:///home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/.system_generated/tasks/task-510.log\"\n}\n\n# Conversation Logs\n\nReference the following log files for the full, untruncated conversation:\n\n- /home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl\n\n**IMPORTANT: this summary is just for your reference. You may respond to my previous and future messages, but DO NOT ACKNOWLEDGE THIS CHECKPOINT MESSAGE. JUST READ IT BUT DO NOT MENTION IT, RESPOND TO IT, OR TAKE ACTION BECAUSE OF IT.**"}
{"step_index":806,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-07-24T02:41:10Z","content":"Reducido. Tenías razón, se sentía un poco disperso el listado.\n\nAnteriormente había ampliado la altura de las filas a `180px` por miedo a que la imagen desplazara el texto hacia arriba y abajo al abrirse, pero haciendo los cálculos matemáticos exactos del tamaño de letra y de la imagen (aprox 96px), me di cuenta que no era necesario tanto colchón.\n\nHe compactado agresivamente el alto mínimo de cada fila de `180px` a `110px`. \nEsto aprisiona mucho más el texto entre las líneas (al puro estilo brutalista de alto contraste), logrando que los proyectos se sientan como un verdadero bloque sólido de información apretada. Y lo mejor: sigue sin haber salto en la pantalla cuando las imágenes se abren.\n\n¡Revisa si te gusta este nivel de compresión o si lo ajustamos más! Y si está perfecto, arrancamos ya con la **Fase 5 (About)**."}
